{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type AnyLitFormApi = TanStackFormController<any, any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/lit-form/src/get-form-type.ts#L31","children":[{"type":"text","value":"get-form-type.ts:31"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A Lit form controller whose form data, validator, and submit types are\nerased."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use it for reusable render helpers that only need controller operations\ncommon to every form. Field paths and values are not checked against a\nparticular form shape; use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LitFormType"},{"type":"text","value":" when a helper depends on one known\nform."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function formSubmitButton(form: AnyLitFormApi) {\n  return form.subscribe(\n    (state) => state.isSubmitting,\n    (isSubmitting) => html`\n      <button type=\"submit\" ?disabled=${isSubmitting}>\n        ${isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n      </button>\n    `,\n  )\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype AnyLitFormApi = TanStackFormController<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [get-form-type.ts:31](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/lit-form/src/get-form-type.ts#L31)\n\nA Lit form controller whose form data, validator, and submit types are\nerased.\n\nUse it for reusable render helpers that only need controller operations\ncommon to every form. Field paths and values are not checked against a\nparticular form shape; use `LitFormType` when a helper depends on one known\nform.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nfunction formSubmitButton(form: AnyLitFormApi) {\n  return form.subscribe(\n    (state) => state.isSubmitting,\n    (isSubmitting) => html`\n      <button type=\"submit\" ?disabled=${isSubmitting}>\n        ${isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n      </button>\n    `,\n  )\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AnyLitFormApi\ntitle: AnyLitFormApi\n---\n\n```ts\ntype AnyLitFormApi = TanStackFormController<any, any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [get-form-type.ts:31](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/lit-form/src/get-form-type.ts#L31)\n\nA Lit form controller whose form data, validator, and submit types are\nerased.\n\nUse it for reusable render helpers that only need controller operations\ncommon to every form. Field paths and values are not checked against a\nparticular form shape; use `LitFormType` when a helper depends on one known\nform.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nfunction formSubmitButton(form: AnyLitFormApi) {\n  return form.subscribe(\n    (state) => state.isSubmitting,\n    (isSubmitting) => html`\n      <button type=\"submit\" ?disabled=${isSubmitting}>\n        ${isSubmitting ? 'Saving...' : 'Save'}\n      </button>\n    `,\n  )\n}\n```\n"}
